<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American HomePatient.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American HomePatient.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it raised American HomePatient Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/8 to 23-1/4.</p>
